          "Address the homeowner majority's material concerns: at 75% homeownership and a 42-year median age, property tax fairness, local service costs, and the economic sustainability of both state government and rural agriculture are the practical governance questions that affect household economic security—these deserve specific policy attention, not abstract partisan positioning."
