          "Address rural healthcare and aging-population service viability directly: with 46.4 median age and high homeownership, SD-33 residents are entering or already in the life stage where rural hospital access, Medicare adequacy, and affordable elder care become urgent—concrete legislative attention to these issues demonstrates that the representative understands the constituency's actual material concerns.",
