          "Serve all demographic communities with specific attention: while the district is 86.2% white and demographically stable, the ~8.8% demographic gap and the Hispanic and Asian populations deserve genuine constituent engagement and acknowledgment—inclusive governance prevents latent resentment from becoming a future opening for a challenger in an otherwise safe seat."
