          "Lead with middle-income homeowner economic security: at $71,523 income with a 41.7 median age, the core constituency is managing healthcare costs, property taxes, school quality, and retirement security on an income that is solid but not abundant. A legislative agenda that takes these material concerns seriously — property tax reform, healthcare affordability, school funding adequacy — is more likely to reconsolidate the fractured 54% and move the 39% than abstract conservative messaging."
